      "The emergency order directs the Midcontinent Independent System Operator (MISO), in coordination with Consumers Energy Company, to ensure that the coal-fired J.H. Campbell Generating Plant (Campbell Plant) in West Olive, Michigan, is available to operate and meet emergency needs while employing economic dispatch to minimize costs for hardworking American families and businesses.",
